{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME</h2><strong>NGfU</strong> is a platform adventure set in an post-cataclysmic Earth now shattered to pieces . Humanity is struggling to survive. Cities are in ruins and abandoned, the air is toxic, no food remains and there is no place to call home. <br><br>You are Joshua Pirlock, a lone young man that arrives in a city thinking finally finding some food, water, or whatever he can that can be useful these hard days. <br><br>A new city, new dangers! As you arrive, you immediately understand that you can't go back, which is one more problem added to your heavy to-do list. You need to find a way to leave this world too.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAMEPLAY</h2><br>The Gameplay is a mix between a classical platformer game and a adventure . The exploration and the story are the main focus in this game . Your journey will bring you to different places , dangers , puzzles and non-comfortable dark places . You have to find a way to solve the puzzles that Joshua finds in his path .<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 2d Adventure-Platformer game with side scrolling mechanics <br></li><li>Different desolated scenarios where everything is in ruin <br></li><li>Very intense music that mixes blues and western <br></li><li>Find out the story and make your right choises </li></ul><br><br>Every thing was made by one man","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2f09183f689facc1f8ba3443a9acf9a4023f319e.jpg","localized_name":"Adventure starts","name":"Adventure starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/713390/2f09183f689facc1f8ba3443a9acf9a4023f319e.jpg"},{"icon":"6ab74acab7570291247fac928f15f1bbe36bb3fa.jpg","localized_name":"No God for Us","name":"No God for Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/713390/6ab74acab7570291247fac928f15f1bbe36bb3fa.jpg"},{"icon":"0b72804965ac4c068b612894369775cfe7aa7052.jpg","localized_name":"Light like air","name":"Light like ai